📖 Program 2 — Read a File Line by Line

📌 Description

This program demonstrates how to open and read a text file line by line using the C++ "ifstream" class.

It uses "getline()" to read each complete line from the file and displays the contents on the screen.

🔑 Concepts Covered

- 📂 Opening a text file for reading
- 📖 Reading data using "ifstream"
- 📝 Reading complete lines using "getline()"
- ⚠️ Checking whether a file opened successfully
- 🔒 Closing the input file

📁 Input File

"message.txt"

🧠 Main C++ Feature

"std::ifstream"
